  "title": "解可化为一次方程的分式方程并验根",
  "stem": "解方程：\\(\\begin{gathered} 2+\\frac { 1 } { x-3 }=\\frac { 2-x } { 3-x } \\\\ \\end{gathered}\\)．",
  "choices": [],
